  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Fund for Poverty Alleviation - Phase 3 - Poverty Annual Knowledge Event Delhi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The conference was focused on the ESRC DFID Joint Fund for Poverty Alleviation as it approaches its final phase. This was an ESRC DFID event coordinated by The Impact Initiative with logistical assistance from Gung Ho event management services. This was a valedictory activity designed to both capture learning from the Fund, help secure its legacy and provide phase 3 and Development Frontiers grant holders support to maximise the impact of their research. This builded on the Joint Fund ten year anniversary in Pretoria held in 2015 which was also supported by the then new Impact Initiative. Held in Dehli.</narrative>
  </description>
